cision, the player with the most landed punches is the winner. Ties are possible.\nWhile the gameplay is simple, there are subtleties, such as getting an opponent on the \"ropes\" and \"juggling\" him back and forth between alternate punches.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 32, "name": "Non-fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/boxing", "videos": [{"id": 103623, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "V21sSSlroZE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V21sSSlroZE", "title": "Boxing Longplay (Intellivision Game)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/V21sSSlroZE/sddefault.jpg"}]}